        "PMC5126569::web::024::hardness_and_oxidation_measurements"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS at approximately 2000 °C under high pressure with a rapid ramp and short dwell will retain single-phase ZrB2.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
